      "text": "Two databases share one PostgreSQL server. Owners never read each other’s tables.\nCheckout and preview bypass Redis. Delivery can repeat; transactional inboxes deduplicate effects.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two databases share one PostgreSQL server. Owners never read each other’s tables.\nCheckout and preview bypass Redis. Delivery can repeat; transactional inboxes deduplicate effects.",
